{
 "type": "doc",
 "version": 1,
 "content": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "1. What happens now"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The first time somebody opens the Inventory Value report in a browser, every column is already switched on - including "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Margin",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Total Sell",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "2. What should happen instead"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Those two columns are meant to start switched off, so the report opens on the narrower default view and the user turns them on if they want them."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Inventory Value requirement S3-R12: \"On first visit, the visible columns are: Part #, Description, Category, Vendor, Qty on Hand, Unit Cost, Unit Sell, Margin %, and Total Cost.\" Margin and Total Sell are not in that list."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Inventory Value requirement S3-R13: \"The Margin and Total Sell columns are hidden by default and can be turned on from the column-selection control.\""
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Inventory Value requirement S8-R3: \"Margin and Total Sell are off by default, the rest on by default.\""
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "3. How to see it"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "orderedList",
   "attrs": {
    "order": 1
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Open a browser window that has never opened this report before (a private window works)."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sign in and open "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Reports",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " > "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Inventory Value",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Read the column headers across the top of the table."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Exact test data this was seen with:",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " no seeding needed. Locations "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Staging Heavy Duty - 9919",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Staging Lethbridge - 4310",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", date range "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "This Month",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "4. What was actually seen"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The headers on a genuine first visit read:"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Part # | Description | Category | Vendor | Location | Qty | Unit Cost | Unit Sell | Margin | Margin % | Total Sell | Total Cost"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The saved view the page writes for itself on that first load also lists all of them, Margin and Total Sell included."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "5. What was ruled out"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not a leftover setting.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " This was a brand-new browser session with nothing stored for this report - the saved view did not exist until the page created it, and it was created with both columns on."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "The control itself works.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " Turning Margin off hides it and turning it back on restores it in the right place, so this is only about the starting state."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not the separate Location question.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The Location column is a different, still-open point. Margin and Total Sell are described plainly in three places with no disagreement."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "6. How often"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Every time, on every fresh browser."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "7. Where it was seen"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Reports > Inventory Value, on the QA branch, build v3.5-16cf83f, on 6 August 2026."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " "
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Inventory Value report specification, version 4, requirement S3-R12, which lists what is on screen at the start: \"On first visit, the visible columns are: Part #, Description, Category, Vendor, Qty on Hand, Unit Cost, Unit Sell, Margin %, and Total Cost.\" Margin and Total Sell are not in that list."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The same specification, requirement S3-R13, says so directly: \"The Margin and Total Sell columns are hidden by default and can be turned on from the column-selection control (Story 8).\" And requirement S8-R3 repeats it: \"Every other column is available in the control; Margin and Total Sell are off by default, the rest on by default (S3-R12).\""
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}